    "sentence_translations": [
      "(2) Alone",
      "",
      "Little Dong called the wrong number.",
      "The old person didn’t recognize him. The old person wanted to say goodbye, but Little Dong said, “Can … can you talk with me?”",
      "",
      "“Talk?” The old person asked.",
      "",
      "“Yes, can you?” Little Dong thought for a bit and said:",
      "“My dad and mom are both very busy, and neither of them is at home. I’m often alone. I want to talk.”",
      "",
      "The old person didn’t want to talk to Little Dong, but she heard him say: “often alone”.",
      "",
      "This old person is called Old Guan. She is 64 years old.",
      "She doesn’t have any family or friends. Old Guan lives in a senior apartment.",
      "There are lots of old people in the senior apartment, but Old Guan doesn’t like talking to them.",
      "She often goes to buy groceries alone, cooks alone, eats alone, and sleeps alone. She is also “often alone”."
    ]
  }
